    "title": "Athens employment at an all-time high - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WUGA ,\n9 hours ago Athens experienced job gains in September. According to the Georgia Department of Labor, the Athens Metropolitan Statistical Area’s labor force and employment both reached all-time highs in September. The Athens Metropolitan Statistical Area is made up of Clarke, Madison, Oconee and Oglethorpe counties. Athens has almost 3,000 more employed... Read full article\n3",
